  "published": "2025-03-27T03:39:05.94Z",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1添加了Consul的帮助类，只需在appsettings.json中配置Consul的相关信息即可使用。\n        \"Consul\": {\n        \"Active\": true,//是否注册,默认true\n        \"Scheme\": \"http\",//http or https,默认http\n        \"HealthCheck\": \"/healthy/Get\",//健康检查地址，默认“/health”\n        \"ServiceName\": \"DemoService\",//注册的服务名称,默认“DemoService”\n        \"ConsulIP\": \"http://127.0.0.1:8500\",//Consul的IP地址,默认“http://127.0.0.1:8500”\n        \"Address\": \"127.0.0.1\",//当前服务的IP地址,默认“127.0.0.1”巨坑这里必须用IP地址，不能用localhost，否则会找不到服务\n        \"Port\": \"80\",//服务端口,默认80\n        \"Datacenter\": \"dc1\",//数据中心,默认“dc1”\n      }\n      启动程序中添加Consul的注册代码即可：\n      // 添加服务发现支持\n      builder.Services.AddDiscoveryClient();\n      // 注册Consul服务\n      app.AddConsul(hostApplicationLifetime, configuration);",
